CORE
port_array5.sv
--top main
^\[main\.sub_inst\.assert\.1\] main\.sub_inst\.bus\[3\]\.i == 30: PROVED
^\[main\.sub_inst\.assert\.2\] main\.sub_inst\.bus\[2\]\.i == 20: PROVED
^\[main\.sub_inst\.assert\.3\] main\.sub_inst\.bus\[1\]\.i == 10: PROVED
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
An array of interface ports (1800-2017 25.4) with a descending range. The
leftmost element of the port connection is the element with index 3.
